{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["search_document: The restored maritime exhibit is packed in crate MEX-2047.","search_document: The courier contact for crate MEX-2047 is Northline Art Logistics.","search_document: Crate MEX-2047 is received at the east loading dock before the gallery handoff.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the insurance binder is filed under the winter loan archive.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the registrar checks frame corners during an unrelated intake.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the gallery lights use a separate evening inspection schedule.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the packing room keeps spare foam on the lower shelf.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the visitor desk prints a separate accessibility map.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the conservation team logs humidity beside the north wall.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the education room stores a duplicate lesson kit.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the courier calendar reserves a different sculpture window.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the archive scanner uses a separate accession profile.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the security desk records an unrelated alarm test.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the donor office sends a separate receipt packet.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the loading crew labels empty pallets after closing.","search_document: museum exhibit shipping: the exhibit photographer stores a backup memory card."],"truncate":false}